6756 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Conducted secondary research on 7 existing small\055scale and household incinerator products available in the market\056\n\nStudied products across different categories\054 including household waste\054 sanitary waste and small institutional incinerators\056\n\nCompared the products based on key features such as capacity\054 size\054 materials\054 energy source\054 operation\054 insulation\054 exhaust system\054 safety\054 maintenance and portability\056\n\nAnalysed the products using a competitive benchmarking matrix to identify their strengths\054 limitations and areas of improvement\056\n\nThe comparison showed that existing products generally focus on waste capacity and combustion efficiency\054 while fewer products focus on compactness\054 intuitive interaction and household\055friendly aesthetics\056\n\nThe research helped identify an opportunity for a compact\054 safe and easy\055to\055use household\055oriented solution\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 6757 0 R
     /Pg 6720 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

